From e638dd22581b994e42e5263f87b8752fbb9f1941 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: netplay <netplay@localhost>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 15:21:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] jtframe: lockstep netplay for MiSTer (JTFRAME_NETPLAY),
 jtbubl built with it

Mailbox in DDR3 at 0x3C000000 shared with screen rotation, frame tick at the
start of the game's vertical blank, clock enable hold without catch-up,
session start at a vertical blank with the enable generators restarted.
Verilator test bench with two machines (verilator/np_test.cpp, bin/np_sim.sh).
